    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/c80c08-d3/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=587506166808969898&sectionId=587506166926607018)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9jdD6fMR2_text","label":"gg9jdD6fMR2_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(233,251,255);color:rgb(48,48,48);font-size:18px;\"><strong>Before it was too late.</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXyqXMH8NB_text","label":"ggXyqXMH8NB_text","default":"<p>This Stops Infections By Protecting Your Dog’s Eyes</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6skj1tFAZ_text","label":"gg6skj1tFAZ_text","default":"<p>After Damian’s frightening eye infection, Elvira discovered something&nbsp;</p><p>that changed everything:&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdbjQ9QkEI_text","label":"ggdbjQ9QkEI_text","default":"<p><strong>Uproot Pet Eye Pad Wipes.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggELdP1AhOD_text","label":"ggELdP1AhOD_text","default":"<p>Recommended by her vet, these wipes offered the perfect solution - gentle yet effective cleaning that protected Damian’s sensitive eyes from future infections.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggfUh7raCZD_text","label":"ggfUh7raCZD_text","default":"<p>Here’s How They Work:</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCIkcU7t41_text","label":"ggCIkcU7t41_text","default":"<p>Thorough Yet Gentle Cleaning</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7bFu7NHdF_text","label":"gg7bFu7NHdF_text","default":"<p>Ingredients like Caprylhydroxamic Acid and Tetrasodium Glutamate Diacetate lift away dirt, discharge, &amp; bacteria without causing irritation.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWiGSwiyPS_text","label":"ggWiGSwiyPS_text","default":"<p>Hydrating and Soothing Properties</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGL90ZRbq__text","label":"ggGL90ZRbq__text","default":"<p>With shea butter and jojoba seed oil, the wipes calm and hydrate the delicate skin around the eyes, reducing redness and preventing scratching or pawing.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0izB7-4w__text","label":"gg0izB7-4w__text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Safe for Regular Use</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyMizCv0Ij_text","label":"ggyMizCv0Ij_text","default":"<p>Ophthalmologist-tested and hypoallergenic, these wipes are perfect for daily use,<span style=\"color:#000000;\"> </span>ensuring thorough cleaning while being kind to even the most sensitive eyes.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBtXXUKJ3V_text","label":"ggBtXXUKJ3V_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\">pH Balancing to Inhibit Bacteria</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDmLGqIjzY_text","label":"ggDmLGqIjzY_text","default":"<p>The formula’s citric acid creates an environment that discourages bacterial growth, stopping infections before they start.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQxB5803tz_text","label":"ggQxB5803tz_text","default":"<p>Elvira Says:</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZv9S5cOcU_text","label":"ggZv9S5cOcU_text","default":"<p>“Switching to Uproot Pet Eye Pad Wipes was the best decision I could have made for Damian. They’re so easy to use, and his eyes haven’t had a single issue since we started using them. I don’t worry about discharge or infections anymore - these wipes are a lifesaver.”</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrnKy6la3h_text","label":"ggrnKy6la3h_text","default":"<p>Like Elvira, pet parents everywhere are discovering the difference Uproot Wipes can make.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>With their gentle yet powerful formula, they’re the go-to choice for happy, healthy eyes.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggzp2D8lors_text","label":"ggzp2D8lors_text","default":"<p>Hundreds Of Pet Owners Swear By Uproot Pet Eye Pad Wipes</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBq5CF8mJP_text","label":"ggBq5CF8mJP_text","default":"<p>Best product I’ve tried!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1bBlz-IGG_text","label":"gg1bBlz-IGG_text","default":"<p>I’ve struggled to keep my dog’s tear stains under control. These wipes are so gentle and effective—I noticed a difference within days. Highly recommend!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSzj8Tr1K3_text","label":"ggSzj8Tr1K3_text","default":"<p>Jessica R.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg_pRiVm4Jy_text","label":"gg_pRiVm4Jy_text","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3Oj0vlgdY_text","label":"gg3Oj0vlgdY_text","default":"<p>Amazing results!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5_xCIOgve_text","label":"gg5_xCIOgve_text","default":"<p>These wipes are a game changer! My pup’s eyes look so much cleaner, and she doesn’t resist when I use them. It’s now part of our daily routine.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLbi2VnR_D_text","label":"ggLbi2VnR_D_text","default":"<p>Michael T.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDXUhqimJk_text","label":"ggDXUhqimJk_text","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8qcIeYaV__text","label":"gg8qcIeYaV__text","default":"<p>Worth every penny</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQrpDYdzvc_text","label":"ggQrpDYdzvc_text","default":"<p>I was skeptical at first, but these wipes really deliver. No irritation, no fuss, and my dog’s eyes are clear and bright. So happy with this purchase!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbYNIrKrps_text","label":"ggbYNIrKrps_text","default":"<p>Sarah K.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5Z87HTa52_text","label":"gg5Z87HTa52_text","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaF56XmJ1C_text","label":"ggaF56XmJ1C_text","default":"New Customer Discount:"},{"type":"html","id":"gghFBBRMOkR_text","label":"gghFBBRMOkR_text","default":"Try Uproot’s Eye Wipes Risk- Free"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNCg0o1JtP_text","label":"ggNCg0o1JtP_text","default":"<p>Your pet’s eye health is too important to take chances. That’s why Uproot is giving you an exclusive opportunity to try our Eye Wipes completely risk-free!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHsZIFygVV_text","label":"ggHsZIFygVV_text","default":"With a Full 60 - Day Guarantee"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4gwjHR5Jk_text","label":"gg4gwjHR5Jk_text","default":"<p>Use the Eye Wipes for a full two months…&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And if you’re not completely satisfied, if they don’t leave your pet’s eyes clean, fresh, and free of irritation…&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>you won’t pay a cent.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPnUSRoaJV_text","label":"ggPnUSRoaJV_text","default":"<p>If for any reason (or no reason at all), you’re not thrilled, just contact our friendly customer service team. They’ll issue a full, no-hassle refund.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0_PXITAaM_childItem_0","label":"gg0_PXITAaM_childItem_0","default":"<p>No Hoops.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggH55VTqNIB_childItem_0","label":"ggH55VTqNIB_childItem_0","default":"<p>No Question.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3qEZnwzEQ_childItem_0","label":"gg3qEZnwzEQ_childItem_0","default":"<p>No Risk.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwn2TvR098_label","label":"ggwn2TvR098_label","default":"<p>Try Risk Free Today ➔&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtgqQIQQpT_text","label":"ggtgqQIQQpT_text","default":"<p>We created Uproot’s Eye Wipes because we believe every pet deserves gentle, effective eye care.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And if our product doesn’t work wonders for your pet, we don’t want your money.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That’s how confident we are that you’ll love how these wipes transform eye cleaning into a fast, gentle, and worry-free experience for both you and your pet.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpbf4gvv9M_text","label":"ggpbf4gvv9M_text","default":"<p>How To: Save EVEN MORE on Your First Order</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvk55e0vKV_text","label":"ggvk55e0vKV_text","default":"<p>Every Uproot Grooming Gloves Pro is designed to simplify grooming, but we’ve made it even easier to save big:</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNwEI-FFIN_text","label":"ggNwEI-FFIN_text","default"